      50.78,
      448.14,
      289.48,
      524.61
    ],
    "text": "Ref. No.: KADU/LAND/01/144/WS. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the following land/servitude has been transferred to the Government for a public purpose.",
