      50.78,
      524.33,
      286.25,
      551.01
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/Servitude transferred to the Government:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.78,
      550.68,
      289.12,
      634.79
    ],
    "text": "All that allotment of land depicted as Lot No. 01 in sheet No. 01, Block No. 01, in the Cadastral Map No. 522011 dated 18.06.2025, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Ratgahawatta, in Grama Niladhari Division, No. 474/A, Raggahawatta in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kaduwela in Colombo District, Western Province and bounded as follows :",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.78,
      634.36,
      286.46,
      695.99
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 1 Name of the Land: Dissawatta alias Katugampolayaowita, Godellawatta, Raggahawatta alias Thimbirigahawatta; Present use of the land: Home Garden, a permanent building and a part of a temporary",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      411.08,
      539.83,
      443.34
    ],
    "text": "building is available; Claimant: State; Original Claimant: Mr. Manjula Palihena, Mr. P. D. Nalaka Palihena, Mrs. Shyamali Palihena; Extent: 0.5514 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      442.6,
      539.72,
      511.05
    ],
    "text": "All persons who claim ownership, interest or any other connection to the aforesaid land/servitude hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me on 16.10.2025 at 09.30 a.m. at the Divisional Secretariat, Kaduwela.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.51,
      511.01,
      539.73,
      587.37
    ],
    "text": "And further you are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) before the 13.10.2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
